#
# MDEV-31527: Add --validate-config option to check configuration
#             without starting the server
#
#
# 1. Valid configuration: only "Configuration is valid." is printed
#
Configuration is valid.
# MTR bootstrap command: only "Configuration is valid."
Configuration is valid.
# --verbose, --silent-startup: only "Configuration is valid."
Configuration is valid.
Configuration is valid.
# "Configuration is valid." goes to stdout, stderr is empty
# stdout:
Configuration is valid.
# stderr:
# valid value in a config file: only "Configuration is valid."
Configuration is valid.
#
# 2. Valid configuration with warnings: the warnings, then
# "Configuration is valid, but warnings were reported; see above."
#
# values adjusted in a config file, [mysqld] and [server] groups:
# two warnings, then "warnings were reported"
[Warning] option 'sort_buffer_size': unsigned value 1 adjusted to 1024
[Warning] Buffered warning: option 'max_connections': unsigned value 0 adjusted to 10
Configuration is valid, but warnings were reported; see above.
# value adjusted on the command line before --validate-config:
# warning, then "warnings were reported"
[Warning] option 'sort_buffer_size': unsigned value 1 adjusted to 1024
Configuration is valid, but warnings were reported; see above.
# plugin option value adjusted: warning, then "warnings were reported"
[Warning] option 'aria-sort-buffer-size': unsigned value 1 adjusted to 16352
Configuration is valid, but warnings were reported; see above.
# unknown --loose- option: warning, then "warnings were reported"
[Warning] mysqld: unknown variable 'loose-zzz-bogus=1'
Configuration is valid, but warnings were reported; see above.
# checks made after option parsing:
# warning, then "warnings were reported"
[Warning] TLSv1.0 and TLSv1.1 are insecure and should not be used for tls_version
Configuration is valid, but warnings were reported; see above.
[Warning] Although a general log file was specified, log tables are used. To enable logging to files use the --log-output option.
Configuration is valid, but warnings were reported; see above.
# malformed Index.xml, error printed outside the error log:
# the error, then "warnings were reported"
mysqld: Error while parsing 'Index.xml': at line 2 pos 1: END-OF-INPUT unexpected (ident or '/' wanted)
Configuration is valid, but warnings were reported; see above.
#
# 3. Invalid configuration: the error and the exit code,
# no "Configuration is valid."
#
# unknown option, exit code 2: error, no "Configuration is valid"
[ERROR] mysqld: unknown option '--nonexistentoption'
[ERROR] Aborting
# unknown plugin variable, exit code 7:
# error, no "Configuration is valid"
[ERROR] mysqld: unknown variable 'aria-bogus=1'
[ERROR] Aborting
# unknown variable in a config file, exit code 7:
# error, no "Configuration is valid"
[ERROR] mysqld: unknown variable 'zzz_bogus_option=123'
[ERROR] Aborting
# unknown variable in a file pulled in by !include, exit code 7:
# error, no "Configuration is valid"
[ERROR] mysqld: unknown variable 'zzz_bogus_option=123'
[ERROR] Aborting
# max_connections=abc, exit code 9: error, no "Configuration is valid"
[ERROR] Buffered error: Unknown suffix 'a' used for variable 'max_connections' (value 'abc'). Legal suffix characters are: K, M, G, T, P, E
[ERROR] Buffered error: mysqld: Error while setting value 'abc' to 'max_connections'
# max_connections=abc in a config file, exit code 9:
# error, no "Configuration is valid"
[ERROR] Buffered error: Unknown suffix 'a' used for variable 'max_connections' (value 'abc'). Legal suffix characters are: K, M, G, T, P, E
[ERROR] Buffered error: mysqld: Error while setting value 'abc' to 'max_connections'
# --thread-handling=bogus, exit code 13:
# error, then max_connections warning, no "Configuration is valid"
[ERROR] mysqld: Error while setting value 'bogus' to 'thread_handling'
[Warning] Buffered warning: option 'max_connections': unsigned value 0 adjusted to 10
# unknown character set, exit code 1:
# error, then max_connections warning
mysqld: Character set 'bogus' is not a compiled character set and is not specified in the 'Index.xml' file
[Warning] Buffered warning: option 'max_connections': unsigned value 0 adjusted to 10
[ERROR] Aborting
# unknown collation, exit code 1: max_connections warning, then error
[Warning] Buffered warning: option 'max_connections': unsigned value 0 adjusted to 10
[ERROR] Unknown collation: 'bogus'
[ERROR] Aborting
# collation does not match the character set, exit code 1:
# max_connections warning, then error
[Warning] Buffered warning: option 'max_connections': unsigned value 0 adjusted to 10
[ERROR] COLLATION 'utf8mb4_bin' is not valid for CHARACTER SET 'latin1'
[ERROR] Aborting
# invalid --ft-boolean-syntax, exit code 1:
# error, then max_connections warning
[ERROR] Invalid ft-boolean-syntax string: x
[Warning] Buffered warning: option 'max_connections': unsigned value 0 adjusted to 10
# extra argument, exit code 1: max_connections warning, then error
[Warning] Buffered warning: option 'max_connections': unsigned value 0 adjusted to 10
mysqld: Too many arguments (first extra is 'extra_argument').
[ERROR] Aborting
# --defaults-file does not exist, exit code 1: error
Could not open required defaults file: MYSQLTEST_VARDIR/tmp/validate_config/missing.cnf
Fatal error in defaults handling. Program aborted
# --defaults-extra-file (without --defaults-file) names a missing file, exit code 1: error
Could not open required defaults file: MYSQLTEST_VARDIR/tmp/validate_config/missing.cnf
Fatal error in defaults handling. Program aborted
#
# 4. --help and --version win over --validate-config:
# "Configuration is valid." and option errors are not printed
#
# --help: help text, no "Configuration is valid"
FOUND 1 /Starts the MariaDB database server/ in validate_config.log
NOT FOUND /Configuration is valid|\[ERROR\]/ in validate_config.log
# --help --verbose: help text, no "Configuration is valid"
FOUND 1 /Starts the MariaDB database server/ in validate_config.log
NOT FOUND /Configuration is valid|\[ERROR\]/ in validate_config.log
# --help with an unknown option: help text, no error
FOUND 1 /Starts the MariaDB database server/ in validate_config.log
NOT FOUND /Configuration is valid|\[ERROR\]/ in validate_config.log
