FOUND 1 /option 'max_connections': unsigned value 0 adjusted to 10/ in validate_config.log
NOT FOUND /Configuration is valid|\[ERROR\]/ in validate_config.log
FOUND 1 /option 'max_connections': unsigned value 0 adjusted to 10/ in validate_config.log
NOT FOUND /Configuration is valid|\[ERROR\]/ in validate_config.log
FOUND 1 /option 'max_connections': unsigned value 0 adjusted to 10/ in validate_config.log
NOT FOUND /Configuration is valid|\[ERROR\]/ in validate_config.log
